容器配置的硬限制为 `64Mi` (证据 2)；崩溃前 Working Set 已高达 `~63.36 MiB` (证据 6)；OOMKilled 状态明确 (证据 1)。\n- **代码行为**：日志显示应用在处理 `/work` 请求时执行了 `allocated_mib` 操作 (证据 3)；Deepflow 流量证实大量 `GET /work` 请求返回 200，说明这些请求成功触发了上述逻辑 (证据 4)。\n\n**未知/需补充**：\n- 首次 OOMKilled 的具体触发时间点缺失（证据 1 仅显示状态）。\n- 缺乏历史数据以判断是否存在内存泄漏趋势，当前现象表现为单次请求或短时间内分配的内存累积导致的越界。\n\n---\n\n## 📊 性能统计\n\n```text\n├─ 总耗时: 2.9m\n├─ 问题定位: 28.7s\n├─ 并发证据采集: 132.5s\n│  └─ g1 aiops-case-08/workload-5c9c7b6489-p8462: 132.5s (Evidence 124.0s, RCA 8.3s)\n└─ 汇总总结: 15.5s\n```\n\n📋 Runbook 参考\n\n- **g1 aiops-case-08/workload-5c9c7b6489-p8462**: pod-crashloop-runtime, pod-oomkilled\n", "answer_source": "workflow", "elapsed_seconds": 176.671, "metrics": {"run_id": "322b6042bcba49b7", "mttr": {"value": "2.9m", "seconds": 176.67798352241516, "pass": true, "threshold": "< 10.0m"}, "evidence_completeness": {"value": "0%", "collected": 0, "planned": 0, "pass": false, "threshold": "> 90%"}, "root_cause_confidence": {"value": "39%", "pass": false, "threshold": ">= 80%"}, "runbook_coverage": {"matched": true, "runbook_id": "pod-oomkilled, pod-crashloop-runtime", "pass": true, "score": 0.85, "breakdown": [{"description": "Runbook 引用", "weight": 0.5, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.5}, {"description": "核心 Runbook 识别", "weight": 0.3, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.09}, {"description": "Runbook 结论关联", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.06}]}, "confidence_breakdown": [{"name": "evidence_strength", "weight": 0.35, "score": 0.0, "weighted_score": 0.0, "description": "加权证据完整率", "detail": "加权完整率 0%"}, {"name": "causal_chain", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.7, "weighted_score": 0.14, "description": "因果链完整性", "detail": "部分因果链"}, {"name": "tool_coverage", "weight": 0.1, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.03, "description": "关键探针覆盖率", "detail": "工具成功率 30%"}, {"name": "runbook_match", "weight": 0.15, "score": 0.8, "weighted_score": 0.12, "description": "Runbook 匹配质量", "detail": "已匹配（未识别核心）"}, {"name": "llm_self_score", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.5, "weig